{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2022-05-19 10:56:00', 'title': "MARSH MCLENNAN RE-ELECTS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DURING 2022 STOCKHOLDERS' MEETING", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) TODAY HELD ITS ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS. DURING THE MEETING, STOCKHOLDERS ELECTED THE ENTIRE SLATE OF 2022 DIRECTOR NOMINEES FOR A ONE-YEAR TERM EXPIRING AT NEXT YEAR'S ANNUAL MEETING. THEY ARE: ANTHONY K. ANDERSON, HAFIZE GAYE ERKAN, OSCAR FANJUL, DANIEL S. GLASER, H. EDWARD HANWAY, DEBORAH C. HOPKINS, TAMARA INGRAM, JANE H. LUTE, STEVEN A. MILLS, BRUCE P. NOLOP, MORTON O. SCHAPIRO, LLOYD M. YATES AND R. DAVID YOST. MARC D. OKEN, WHO"}